usage: tool COMMAND [ARGS...]

Human commands:
app
complete
completion
help, -h, --help
info
version
which
widget

Namespaces:
ochazuke., ochazuke

Machine commands (JSON / JSON Lines):
catalog
command
commands
state

Run 'tool COMMAND --help' for command details.

CLI execution: each call uses a fresh local runtime; results are JSON (--format table|markdown|toon for a list's rows).
--target selects an instance; --yes (or -y) accepts confirmation.
Run 'tool help --all' for every command and the full notes.
